The '''Moonglade Beacon''' is a beacon in the {{Zone|South Reaches}} that, once tuned properly, grants increased {{Stat|Fig Fortune}} and {{Stat|Mangrove Fortune}} depending on how many {{Aqua|stacks}} it has and its {{Aqua|signal strength}}.

== Overview ==
=== Frequency Tuning ===
To tune the '''Moonglade Beacon''', one must correctly match the {{Green|Color}}, {{Green|Speed}}, and {{Green|Pitch}} of a beat (telegraphed by colored glass panes). Successfully tuning the beacon will grant {{Green|+1 Stack}} to all players on the island for {{Green|20}} minutes. Each {{Green|Stack}} grants {{Stat|Fig Fortune|+5}} and {{Stat|Mangrove Fortune|+5}}. Players by default can only get bonuses from {{Green|5}} stacks.

There is also a 10% chance to obtain a {{Item|Beaconmite Shard}}, which when syphoned, grants the {{Attr|Beacon Zealot}} attribute. 

=== Increasing Signal Strength ===
==== Beacon Zealot ====
The {{Attr|Beacon Zealot}} attribute, obtained from the {{Item|Beaconmite Shard}} increases the stats granted by the beacon to the player by {{Green|10%->100%}}. This percentage bonus is applied after the raw stat bonus from Signal Enhancers. Additionally it also grants a {{Green|0.1%->1%}} chance to obtain {{Item|Signal Enhancer}}s from [[Tree Gifts]].

==== Signal Enhancers ====
{{Main|Signal Enhancer}}
A {{Item|Signal Enhancer}} can be used to increase the {{Green|Signal Strength}} of the '''Moonglade Beacon'''. This can be done a maximum of {{Green|10}} times. Before obtaining the bonus, players must first solve a harder version of the Frequency Tuning minigame. The Signal Enhancer is only consumed after being solved. Each level of {{Green|Signal Strength}} grants an additional {{Stat|Fig Fortune|+0.5}} and {{Stat|Mangrove Fortune|+0.5}} per {{Green|Stack}} from the '''Moonglade Beacon'''. Every other{{confirm}} consumed Signal Enhancer also increases the number of stacks players can be affected by by {{Green|1}} up to a total maximum of {{Green|10}}.

With {{Attr|Beacon Zealot X}} and {{Green|10}} consumed [[Signal Enhancer]]s, players can get up to {{stat|Fig Fortune|200}} and {{stat|Mangrove Fortune|200}} from the '''Moonglade Beacon''', compared to the default maximum of {{stat|fig fortune|icononly=true|25}} of each.
